  (text "B2 — POWER: USB-C / 5 V jack entry, ideal-diode ORing, +-12 V isolated modules, +5VA and +3V3 LDOs" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f2b2ad6a-a760-5bb3-aa72-a80075d171a4"))
  (text "Entry: 1.5 A polyfuse -> SMF5.0A TVS -> LM66100 ideal diode per input (CE = GND, always on; the higher source wins, reverse current blocked). Drop ~0.18 V typ at 1.2 A vs 0.5 V for the Schottky ORing (D-02)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 19 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "96179699-73fa-50ad-b79f-2aff42188f85"))
  (text "+-12 V: two unregulated B0512S-2WR3 (10 % minimum load rule!): +12 V rail loaded by 78L05 + bleeder, -12 V rail by OPA2192 + 3 x 2.2k bleeder (16 mA) so both stay inside the +-15 % envelope (datasheet p.3/4)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 22.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "347da064-9155-536b-963f-a2dac7f62196"))
  (text "78L05G (SOT-89, 350 mW max): +12 V -> +5VA for ADS8688/DAC8563 AVDD; ~17 mA -> 0.12 W. AMS1117-3.3: 22 uF output required for stability (datasheet 'Stability'); ceramic used, tantalum drop-in (3216) if the rail rings." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "30d3e908-1298-5d59-a095-37111728f3af"))
  (text "All power-module outputs are referenced to AGND (-12 V module: +Vo = AGND). GND and AGND meet only at NT1 (base sheet)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "166369ad-4f52-5f87-b82e-69696cc4da9b"))
  (text "CC1/CC2 5.1k = UFP sink, 5 V. Shield pads to GND directly (no chassis)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 125 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ae4826e1-b568-5d62-b3e5-445eba602a55"))
  (text "Jack: 5 V DC, centre +, 5.5/2.1 mm, 1.5-3 A. Switch pin unused." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a8c9e764-08a8-5f7c-95c6-1f1a5e6de6d0"))
  (text "+5V_RAW rail (both LM66100 outputs): bulk 22 uF + 100 nF, green LED (2.9 mA); PWR_FLAG = ideal diodes drive the rail" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160 92 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dfaded62-32d2-53b4-bc62-4371f6f6344a"))
  (text "+3V3: AMS1117-3.3 (SOT-223), 22 uF ceramic out (tantalum 3216 drop-in if needed), pin 4 = tab (same VOUT net on the footprint)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 200 145 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c92f094d-1a45-593f-886c-22404b455d7b"))
  (text "+12V: FB + 22 uF + 100 nF at the module; 3 x 2.2k = 16 mA bleeder guarantees the 10 % minimum load with 78L05 load included" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 239.4 199 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e748a091-cb21-5e17-ab58-71bd93d6c37f"))
  (text "-12V: module #2 with +Vo on AGND; FB in the -Vo line; 3 x 2.2k bleeder (16 mA) + LED keep the 10 % minimum load without the OPT chain" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 239.4 265 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ba5085c2-38db-5ee0-ac43-ac2917f18113"))
  (text "Isolated 2 W modules: input 4.5-5.5 V, 454 mA full load, ripple 80 mVp-p max, Cout <= 560 uF, 1.5 kVDC isolation (YLPTEC datasheet)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 200 152 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "476f9f17-47d7-5e33-a8fe-d3a08657e61f"))
  (text "+5VA: 78L05G from +12V (dropout 1.7 V), ADC/DAC analog supply, AGND-referenced; 0.12 W at 17 mA" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 300 138 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5abd14b7-8982-55e8-a4eb-22ad840bea05"))
  (text "Rail test points" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 252 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "79855104-353f-54e6-a93c-66bed345776a"))
